// grDepthMask(FxBool enable) -> void. 1 dword arg, decorated
// _grDepthMask@4 -- confirmed against Ignition's own real call this
// iteration (G6's hardware log gave SEVENTH_GLIDE_CALL=grDepthMask,
// caller_guest_eip=0x00458700, arg0=0). Confirmed by direct disassembly +
