// MSVC IAT jump-thunk (`JMP DWORD PTR [0x46a1c0]`) -- a DIFFERENT thunk
// cluster than G5-G9's (0x468cXX), confirming thunk clusters are simply
// grouped per translation unit, not a single contiguous table -- and
// 0x0046a1c0 is glide2x.dll's IAT slot #3 (re-parsed this iteration
// directly from the Import Name Table at OriginalFirstThunk RVA 0x6C958,
// same methodology as the original G5 audit), whose import-table name is
// `_grBufferClear@12` -- an exact match. No EAX test follows the call
// (next instruction at 0x458731 is `PUSH 0x0` for the following call --
// and 0x458731 is exactly the caller_guest_eip G9's TENTH_GLIDE_CALL log
// reported), confirming a void return.
