// field at offset +0x18, read off the SAME struct family, appears
// repeatedly in SIBLING case-handlers of the particle/effect dispatcher
// this function belongs to (0x0044ff20, see this file's G51 comment) --
// e.g. at 0x0044ffde (`mov cl,[eax+0x8]`... different struct instance
