// TEXTURE-HANDLE-DEREFERENCE HYPOTHESIS (Part 12-27): directly audited,
// NOT confirmed. Two independent facts rule it out as the cause of THIS
// branch:
//   1) Real Glide 2.x's own contract: `GrMipMapId_t guTexAllocateMemory
