// DECISION: per this iteration's own explicit instruction ("IF NATIVE
// WINDOWS ITSELF PRODUCES NaN ... DO NOT zero automatically... report it
// and make that the next target"), G71's compat is DELIBERATELY NOT
// extended to this caller pair. legacy_quad_family=PROVEN (0x00452270 is
